    {
      "task": "find oak_planks",
      "milestone_id": "find_oak_planks",
      "description": "Uses position_near_with_facing because this is a find/locate task. The player must navigate near the oak_planks structure (placed at spawn-relative ~5-6, 0-1, 5-6) and face it, confirming they have visually located it. Target is the center of the 6-block structure. Max distance 16 allows detection from a reasonable viewing range, and facing tolerance 60° ensures the player is actually looking at the structure.",
